```cint fn_noreturn.ci
I64 signum(I64 x) {
    if (x < 0) {
        return -1;
    } else if (x > 0) {
        return 1;
    }
}

"{signum(5)}\n";
```

```text
error[C4001]: missing return
  --> fn_noreturn.ci:1:5
   |
 1 | I64 signum(I64 x) {
   |     ^
```

10. A result that is neither used nor discarded is rejected:

```cint fn_unused.ci
I64 twice(I64 x) {
    return 2 * x;
}

twice(3);
_ = twice(4);
```

