  --> for_c.ci:1:29
   |
 1 | for (I8 k = 125; k <= 127; k++) {
   |                             ^ add.checked.i8
   |
   = operation: add.checked.i8
   = operand-count: 2
   = operand: I8 127
   = operand: I8 1
