## the program

```ci
I64 year = 2024;
Bool leap = year % 4 == 0 && (year % 100 != 0 || year % 400 == 0);
if (leap) {
    "{year} is a leap year\n";
} else {
    "{year} is not a leap year\n";
}
"leap = {leap}\n";
```

Run it:

```text
2024 is a leap year
